# The Mandate gateway this store takes agent orders from.
# GATEWAY_URL=https://mandate-gateway.vercel.app
# This store's public address. On Vercel it is worked out automatically.
# STORE_URL=https://your-store.example
# Optional. An Ed25519 private key (base64 of its PKCS8 PEM). When set, the store publishes the public half as
# "signing_key" and signs its requests to the gateway. See "Signing requests to the gateway" in the README.
# STORE_SIGNING_KEY=
